emit metadata must be a static JSON object and emitted IDs are globally unique;
only in and out directives have host behavior;
maps currently load from local files in the Node host;
Markdown body ranges and generated provenance maps preserve exact UTF-16 offsets for direct source text and substitutions; transforms that alter text are represented as intentionally coarse attribution.

